      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should be required to be unsigned. Technically we could allow signed but so far nothing using ityp has needed signed index types, and they\u0027re harder to reason about. (There\u0027s at least one thing in here that assumes it.)\n\n```\n    static_assert(HasUnsignedUnderlyingType\u003cIndex\u003e, \"Index type must be unsigned\");\n```",
