      "message": "Let\u0027s do that as a follow up if you don\u0027t mind as I\u0027m not sure I understand what concretely needs to happen to resolve this comment. I\u0027m confused at the part about `std::rangers::copy` because that takes a whole span and extracts iterators, so it should be safe even in the current code. What we seem to not have are direct manipulations of the iterators.",
